        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2570] A private SECC that did not offer OCSP responses for its PE certificate chain shall not provide PnC as an authorization service. Such a private SECC shall not indicate PnC as a supported service in AuthorizationServices parameter in AuthorizationSetupRes message. Consequently, this private SECC shall not include PnC_ASResAuthorizationMode in AuthorizationSetupRes message.",
            "block_bbox": [
